>In the June issue of UnixReview Antoinette Agracewicz writes:
>"... unconfirmed rumors indicate that the OSF is considering
>replacing its DFS with Sun's popular NFS."

No.

DFS is part of the current DCE release, and we are doing active work on it
for DCE 1.1 (e.g., extending its ACL manager to support delegation like
the rest of DCE).

