># /sbin/mount -rd /dev/rz4c /mnt
>/dev/rz4c on /mnt: No valid filesystem exists on this partition
>
>
lihsin;

  The Alpha Freeware CD is ISO9660 format. Use the command:

	mount -t cdfs -r -o nodefperm /dev/rz4c /mnt

  You must have the ISO9660 support compiled in the kernel for this
to work. You must have the line:

options         CDFS

in your /sys/conf/'SYSTEM-NAME-IN-UPPERCASE' configuration file.

